<p rendition="#indent-2">3<hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#sup"><hi rendition="#aq">a.</hi></hi></hi> &#x2020;. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Rubra</hi>. F. testacea, oculis punctoque<lb/>
