<hi rendition="#aq">Pl</hi>. II.</p></note>.</p>  <p rendition="#indent-2">4. &#x2020;. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Caespitum</hi>. F. abdominis petiolo binodo-<lb/>
