tis, thorace flavo, fascia fusca, abdomine<lb/>
flavo apice nigro</hi>. *</p>  <p rendition="#indent-2">2. &#x2020;. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Tarandi</hi></hi>. Die Rennthierbremse. <hi rendition="#aq">O. alis<lb/>
