<pb n="439" facs="#f0451" xml:id="pb439_0001"/>
<p rendition="#indent-2">3. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Antipathes</hi></hi>. Das schwarze Corall. <hi rendition="#aq">I. stirpe<lb/>
