tunicato-corticata. Animal hydra.</hi></p>  <p rendition="#indent-2">1. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Epipetrum</hi>. A. stirpe cavata carnosa ruse-<lb/>
scente.</hi> *</p>  <p rendition="#indent-2">2. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Gelatinosum</hi>. A. polymorphum gelatino-<lb/>
sum.</hi></p>  <p rendition="#indent-1">64. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#k"><hi rendition="#g">spongia</hi></hi></hi>. Sauge-Schwamm. <hi rendition="#aq">Stirps<lb/>
